# Touch Mode (#178, #222; docs/steps/2026-11-18-ready-222.md) on the agents' iPad (iPad Pro 13-inch (M5), iOS 27.0,
# upright: a sideways screen is drawn a quarter turn round): the Settings panel at its row (its footnote's Pencil
# sentence), sideways and upright; the tour's picture card in Trackpad mode (the Pencil's row) and in Direct Touch
# (main's); the stream screen in Trackpad mode, which must be main's pixel for pixel.
#   Scripts/harness-photos.sh Scripts/harness-photos/touch-mode-ipad.cases --device ipad --baseline origin/main
ipad-touch-trackpad     -SillLayout 1376x1032 -SillSafeArea 24,0,20,0 -SillSettings 1 -SillSettingsScroll touch -Sill.touchMode trackpad
ipad-upright-touch      -SillLayout 1032x1376 -SillSafeArea 24,0,20,0 -SillSettings 1 -SillSettingsScroll touch
ipad-tour-trackpad      -SillLayout 1376x1032 -SillSafeArea 24,0,20,0 -SillTourState fresh -SillTour touch -Sill.touchMode trackpad --wait=6
ipad-tour-direct        -SillLayout 1376x1032 -SillSafeArea 24,0,20,0 -SillTourState fresh -SillTour touch --wait=6
ipad-stream-trackpad    -SillLayout 1376x1032 -SillSafeArea 24,0,20,0 -Sill.touchMode trackpad
